@startuml Feedback-System-Sequence
title Anonymous Feedback System with Optional ID Decryption

actor "Employee" as Employee
participant "Client App" as Client
participant "FeedbackController" as FeedbackCtrl
participant "FeedbackService" as FeedbackSvc
participant "Encryption\nModule" as Crypto
participant "MongoDB" as DB
actor "HR Manager" as HR
actor "Admin" as Admin

== Submit Anonymous Feedback ==

Employee -> Client: Write feedback\n(anonymous mode)
Client -> Client: Prompt: "Submit anonymously?"

Employee -> Client: Confirm anonymous submission

Client -> FeedbackCtrl: POST /feedback\n{content, category, anonymous: true}

activate FeedbackCtrl
FeedbackCtrl -> FeedbackSvc: create(createFeedbackDto, currentUser)
activate FeedbackSvc

FeedbackSvc -> FeedbackSvc: Validate feedback content

alt Anonymous feedback
  ' Encrypt employee ID
  FeedbackSvc -> Crypto: encryptEmployeeId(currentUser._id)
  activate Crypto
  
  note right of Crypto
    Encryption method:
    - Algorithm: AES-256-CBC or RSA
    - Generate unique encryption key
    - Store encrypted ID as hash
    - Original user ID not stored in plain text
  end note
  
  Crypto -> Crypto: Generate AES key\nEncrypt employee ID
  Crypto --> FeedbackSvc: {encryptedId, encryptionKey}
  deactivate Crypto
  
  FeedbackSvc -> FeedbackSvc: Store feedback with:\n- encryptedEmployeeId\n- encryptionKey (hashed)\n- anonymous: true\n- Original userId NOT saved
  
else Non-anonymous feedback
  FeedbackSvc -> FeedbackSvc: Store feedback with:\n- employeeId (plain)\n- anonymous: false
end

FeedbackSvc -> DB: Insert feedback document
activate DB
DB --> FeedbackSvc: Feedback created with _id
deactivate DB

FeedbackSvc -> FeedbackSvc: Generate feedback tracking ID

FeedbackSvc --> FeedbackCtrl: Created feedback\n{feedbackId, trackingId}
deactivate FeedbackSvc

FeedbackCtrl --> Client: 201 Created\n{feedbackId, trackingId}
deactivate FeedbackCtrl

Client --> Employee: Feedback submitted successfully\nTracking ID: XXXXX

== View Feedback List (HR Manager) ==

HR -> Client: View all feedback
Client -> FeedbackCtrl: GET /feedback?status=pending

activate FeedbackCtrl
FeedbackCtrl -> FeedbackSvc: findAll(pagination, filters)
activate FeedbackSvc

FeedbackSvc -> DB: Query feedback\n(filter by status, category, etc.)
activate DB
DB --> FeedbackSvc: List of feedback\n(encrypted IDs for anonymous)
deactivate DB

FeedbackSvc -> FeedbackSvc: Format response:\nHide employee identity\nfor anonymous feedback

FeedbackSvc --> FeedbackCtrl: Feedback list
deactivate FeedbackSvc

FeedbackCtrl --> Client: 200 OK\n[{id, content, category, anonymous, createdAt}]
deactivate FeedbackCtrl

Client --> HR: Display feedback list\n(shows "Anonymous" for hidden identities)

== View Single Feedback ==

HR -> Client: Open feedback details
Client -> FeedbackCtrl: GET /feedback/:id

activate FeedbackCtrl
FeedbackCtrl -> FeedbackSvc: findOne(id)
activate FeedbackSvc

FeedbackSvc -> DB: Find feedback by ID
activate DB
DB --> FeedbackSvc: Feedback document
deactivate DB

FeedbackSvc -> FeedbackSvc: Check if anonymous:\nDo not include employee details

FeedbackSvc --> FeedbackCtrl: Feedback details\n(employee ID hidden if anonymous)
deactivate FeedbackSvc

FeedbackCtrl --> Client: 200 OK\n{feedback details}
deactivate FeedbackCtrl

Client --> HR: Display feedback\n(shows content, category, timestamp)

== Decrypt Feedback ID (Admin Only) ==

HR -> Client: Critical issue detected\nNeed to identify employee

Client -> HR: Request admin approval

HR -> Admin: Request ID decryption\nfor feedback #XXXXX

Admin -> Client: Login as admin
Client -> FeedbackCtrl: POST /feedback/decrypt/:id\n{reason, adminPassword}

activate FeedbackCtrl

' Verify admin permissions
FeedbackCtrl -> FeedbackCtrl: Verify admin role\nand authorization

alt Not authorized
  FeedbackCtrl --> Client: 403 Forbidden
  Client --> Admin: Access denied
else Authorized
  FeedbackCtrl -> FeedbackSvc: decryptFeedbackId(id, reason, admin)
  activate FeedbackSvc
  
  FeedbackSvc -> DB: Find feedback
  activate DB
  DB --> FeedbackSvc: Feedback with encrypted ID
  deactivate DB
  
  alt Feedback is not anonymous
    FeedbackSvc --> FeedbackCtrl: Error: Feedback not anonymous
    FeedbackCtrl --> Client: 400 Bad Request
    Client --> Admin: Cannot decrypt non-anonymous feedback
  else Feedback is anonymous
    FeedbackSvc -> Crypto: decrypt(encryptedId, encryptionKey)
    activate Crypto
    
    Crypto -> Crypto: Retrieve decryption key\nDecrypt employee ID
    
    Crypto --> FeedbackSvc: Original employee ID
    deactivate Crypto
    
    ' Log the decryption for audit
    FeedbackSvc -> DB: Create audit log:\n{feedbackId, decryptedBy, reason, timestamp}
    activate DB
    DB --> FeedbackSvc: Audit log saved
    deactivate DB
    
    ' Get employee details
    FeedbackSvc -> DB: Find employee by decrypted ID
    activate DB
    DB --> FeedbackSvc: Employee data
    deactivate DB
    
    ' Update feedback status
    FeedbackSvc -> DB: Update feedback:\nset identityRevealed = true\nset revealedBy = admin\nset revealReason = reason
    activate DB
    DB --> FeedbackSvc: Updated
    deactivate DB
    
    FeedbackSvc --> FeedbackCtrl: {employee: {id, name, email}, decryptionLog}
    deactivate FeedbackSvc
    
    FeedbackCtrl --> Client: 200 OK\n{employeeId, name, email, timestamp}
    deactivate FeedbackCtrl
    
    Client --> Admin: Employee identified:\nName, Email, Department
    
    Admin -> Admin: Take appropriate action\nbased on feedback
  end
end

== Respond to Feedback ==

HR -> Client: Write response to feedback
Client -> FeedbackCtrl: PATCH /feedback/:id\n{response, status: "resolved"}

activate FeedbackCtrl
FeedbackCtrl -> FeedbackSvc: update(id, updateDto, currentUser)
activate FeedbackSvc

FeedbackSvc -> DB: Update feedback\nwith response and status
activate DB
DB --> FeedbackSvc: Updated feedback
deactivate DB

FeedbackSvc -> FeedbackSvc: Mark as resolved\nSet resolvedBy and resolvedAt

alt Employee identity known
  FeedbackSvc -> FeedbackSvc: Send notification to employee
end

FeedbackSvc --> FeedbackCtrl: Updated feedback
deactivate FeedbackSvc

FeedbackCtrl --> Client: 200 OK
deactivate FeedbackCtrl

Client --> HR: Response saved

note right of DB
  Audit trail includes:
  - Who decrypted the ID
  - When it was decrypted
  - Reason for decryption
  - All actions taken
  Ensures accountability
end note

note left of Crypto
  Security measures:
  - Strong encryption (AES-256)
  - Unique keys per feedback
  - Key rotation possible
  - Multi-level access control
  - Complete audit logging
end note

@enduml
